# Button

### Shared Design Specification

#### Base Layout
`display`: `block`, `text-align`: `center`, `user-select`: `none`, `border`: `1px solid`, `cursor`: `pointer`, `margin`: `0` , `font-family`: `Trust Hartford Sans, arial, sans-serif`, `line-height`: `1.5`, `border-radius`: `0.25rem`, `font-weight`: `700`, `width`:`200px`


#### Icon / Image
`display`: `inline-block`, `vertical-align`: `middle`
- If `include icon/image` is `true` for `primary outlined button`, `secondary outlined button`:
  - **Default (Idle / Before Hover):** Render `before hover svg` inside the button icon slot.
  - **Hover / Active State:** Swap to render `after hover svg`.


#### Responsive Sizing


##### Small Button
`padding`: `4px 8px 4px 8px`, `font-size`: `14px`, `line-height`: `1.5`, `icon width`: `16px`, `icon height`: `16px`
* Mobile (< 768px):
`width`: `100%`


##### Medium Button
`padding`: `7px 12px 7px 12px`,`font-size`: `16px`,  `icon width`: `18px`, `icon height`: `18px`
* Mobile (< 768px):
   `width`: `100%`


##### Large Button
* Desktop & Tablet (≥ 768px):
    `padding`: `8px 16px 8px 16px`, `font-size`: `18px`, `icon width`: `20px`, `icon height`: `20px`,
* Mobile (< 768px):
    `width`: `100%`

