 `position`: `absolute`, `top`: `15px`, `right`: `15px`, `font-size`:`55px`,`z-index`: `1`, `display`: `inline-flex`, `align-items`: `center`, `justify-content: center`, `width`: `32px`, `height`: `32px`, `padding`: `0`, `border`: `0`, `background`: `transparent`, `cursor`: `pointer`, `opacity`: `1`, `color`: `#3a5a78`, `filter`: `drop-shadow(0 1px 0 #ffffff)`
